      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This report is a summary of the experience at a tertiary medical care facility with patients who had undergone exercise testing soon after placement of coronary arterial stents. In 261 patients, no acute coronary events occurred that could be attributed to the exercise tests."},
